      "en": "Airports:\n- Campinas (Viracopos): About 3 hours from Santos by car. Not recommended.\n- Congonhas: About 40 minutes to 1 hour from Santos, but there are few direct bus times to Santos and it's hard to match them with flights.\n- Guarulhos (GRU): The best option if you're coming from out of town. It's about 1 hour 40 minutes from Santos, but Viação Cometa runs buses continuously straight to Santos, and even straight to the port.\n- If you arrive at the Santos bus station, you're only 10 minutes by Uber/taxi from the Concais Terminal.",
      "es": "Aeropuertos:\n- Campinas (Viracopos): Queda a ~3 horas de Santos en auto. No se recomienda.\n- Congonhas: Queda a ~40 minutos a 1 hora de Santos, pero tiene pocos horarios de bus directo a Santos y es difícil coordinarlos con los vuelos.\n- Guarulhos (GRU): Es la mejor opción para quienes vienen de fuera. Queda a ~1 h 40 min de Santos, pero hay buses de Viação Cometa con salidas continuas directo a Santos e incluso directo al puerto.\n- Quien llegue a la terminal de buses de Santos está a solo 10 minutos en Uber/taxi de la Terminal Concais."
